# live.list - packages present only in the live ISO session, not in the installed system.
# Format: one package per line; '#' lines are comments; no inline comments.

# Live-boot framework: casper builds the overlay root from squashfs and runs the live user setup.
casper
# Discovers the live medium and mounts it for casper.
discover
# Live-session user and hostname plumbing pulled in by casper.
live-config
# Live-session hardware detection and driver hints (live only; installed system keeps its own choice).
ubuntu-drivers-common
# Live-session partition tool, reachable from the menu before installation.
gparted
# Installer fallback frontend is NOT listed here. If the Calamares fallback is taken, see DESIGN.md section 5.
